b/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-17540](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-17540)\n### Description\n\n`FormatBytesAsStr` converts `n` (length) from unsigned to signed integer. But the check\nfor `max_length` is `max_length > 1`, which causes the loop to not exit properly when `n` is\nsufficiently large and the cast to signed integer overflows:\n\n```\n  int64_t bytes_left = static_cast<int64_t>(n - 1);\n  for (const char* p = data; p != end; ++p, --bytes_left) {\n    // ...\n\n    if (result.size() >= max_length && bytes_left > 1) {\n      result.append(Substitute(\"<...$0 bytes skipped>\", bytes_left));\n      break;\n    }\n  }\n```\n\nWhen an unintended code path is executed (due to product bug like #27923 or data corruption cases), and certain information needs to be logged to the errorlog file, it can run into the above issue, causing huge memory allocations, that can cause OOM in the system and cause Tservers to crash. \n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/enhancement\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-17540]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-17540?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/27924/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/27924/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":18551573972,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOBlCVUc6_nGjWzwAAAARRwo3U","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/18551573972","actor":{"login":"yugabyte-ci","id":17281578,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjgxNTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17281578?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte-ci","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"unlabeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-07-09T18:33:00Z","label":{"name":"status/awaiting-triage","color":"E33F0D"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":18551574659,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOBlCVUc6_nGjWzwAAAARRwpCD","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyt